  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox geography vcard vevent\" style=\"width:265px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"3\" class=\"fn org summary\" style=\"text-align:center; line-height:1.2em; font-size:135%; font-weight:bold;\">Kingdom of Al-Hasa\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"vertical-align:middle; text-align:center; border-top:solid 1px #aaa; padding:0.2em 0em 0.2em 0em;\">\n<table style=\"width:100%; text-align:center; margin:0 auto; background:transparent;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:50px; border:0; vertical-align:middle; font-size:30%; line-height:105%;\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Arabia (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJhYmlhP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\"><span style=\"font-size:300%;\">←</span></span> <span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=Blank.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Blank.png\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"30\">File:Blank.png</span></a></span><br />\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:middle; text-align:center; font-size:115%; border:0;\"><b>2055?–2139</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50px; border:0; vertical-align:middle; text-align:right; line-height:105%; font-size:30%;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:Error mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Upload?wpDestFile=Blank.png\" class=\"new\" title=\"File:Blank.png\"><span class=\"mw-file-element mw-broken-media\" data-width=\"30\">File:Blank.png</span></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arabian_Association\" title=\"Arabian Association\"><span style=\"font-size:300%;\">→</span></a><br />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"3\" class=\"maptable\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/2/23/Flag_of_Saudi_Arabia.png/revision/latest?cb=20171203143540\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Flag of Al-Hasa\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/2/23/Flag_of_Saudi_Arabia.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/125?cb=20171203143540\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"125\" height=\"83\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Flag of Saudi Arabia.png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_Saudi_Arabia.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span><br /> Flag\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Capital</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><i>Not specified</i>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Government</b>\n</td>\n<td>Unitary Islamic absolute monarchy\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Legislature</b>\n</td>\n<td>None\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n<td style=\"width:1.0em; padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:0;text-align:left;\">Upper house\n</td>\n<td>Council of Ministers\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n<td style=\"width:1.0em; padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:0;text-align:left;\">Lower house\n</td>\n<td>Consultative Assembly\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>History</b>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n<td style=\"width:1.0em; padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:0em;text-align:left;\">Established\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\">2055?\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n<td style=\"width:1.0em; padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:0em;text-align:left;\">Dissolution\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\">2139\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Today part of</b>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Arabian_Association\" title=\"Arabian Association\">Arabian Association</a>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><b>Al-Hasa</b>, officially the <b>Kingdom of Al-Hasa</b>, was a sovereign Arab state in the Middle East and Western Asia, that participated in the <a href=\"/wiki/Third_Mexican-American_War\" title=\"Third Mexican-American War\">Third Mexican-American War</a>. Al-Hasa was bordered by Kuwait and Nadj to the north, Muscat and Abu Dhabi to the east, Aden to the south, and Asir to the west. Al-Hasa is recognized as the successor state to Arabia and the original Saudi Kingdom, with it's royal family and titles consisting of descendents of the Saudi family and related figures. The official language of Al-Hasa was Arabic, with English being regarded as a secondary language. The official religion was Sunni Islam, while Chrisitanity and Shia Islam followers making up less than 10% of the population.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119081701\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.046 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.063 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 860/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9051/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1425/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/100\nExpensive parser function count: 12/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.002/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 639893/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44.898      1 Template:Infobox_former_country\n100.00%   44.898      1 -total\n 54.61%   24.519      2 Template:Ns0\n 48.63%   21.833      1 Template:Infobox_former_country/autocat\n 24.18%   10.857      2 Template:Str_find\n  4.69%    2.106      2 Template:Ordinal\n  3.23%    1.452      1 Template:Both\n  2.44%    1.095      2 Template:!!\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_secondrenai